msgstr "刚体顶点动画纹理：网格 .fbx、两个 .exr 纹理和一个 .json。Unity 的着色器和脚本需单独下载"

#: ui.py:272
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Run the RBD Bullet Solver node of the active object and store the result on it. Other selected objects that have a solver node are simulated in the same world, so they collide with each other"
msgstr "运行活动物体的 RBD Bullet Solver 节点并将结果存储在其上。其他选定且带解算器节点的物体将在同一世界中模拟，因此会相互碰撞"

